<!--
  ⚠️ PLACEHOLDER ARTWORK — replace with your real logo.

  This resource is referenced in three places:
    - AndroidManifest.xml  android:icon="@drawable/logo"
    - AndroidManifest.xml  android:roundIcon="@drawable/logo"
    - LoginScreen.kt       painterResource(id = R.drawable.logo)

  It's a simple leaf mark drawn to suit the "fresh produce" theme and to
  render correctly at both icon size and the 100dp size LoginScreen uses.
  Note LoginScreen already tints the background green and clips it to a
  rounded square, so this draws the mark in white on transparent.

  For a real launcher icon you'd normally want an adaptive icon
  (mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml + foreground/background layers) rather
  than a single drawable — worth doing before release, but not needed to build.
-->
